  "Description":          "Newspaper Reader: receives the image of a newspaper page and, when the person has pointed at the top of a column, the Point; returns the text of that column as a Portable Avatar, which reads it. Optical Character Recognition finds the lines of a band of the page about the Point; Column Text Selection takes the text of the column; Portable Avatar Multiplexing puts it in the Portable Avatar.",

